class_name NightmareEnemyData
extends RefCounted
## Level 3 — The Nightmare Realm — enemy definitions (Minifantasy_Monster_Creatures pack).
##
## Thirteen rank-and-file roles; the miniboss and final boss live in their own factories
## (CentaurKingData / AngelOfDeathData) because bosses carry choreographed skills.
##
##   nm_fodder      Giant Rat              — fragile melee swarm
##   nm_swarmer     Dire Wolf              — fastest unit, paper-thin (Werewolf wolf shape)
##   nm_skirmisher  Gnoll                  — standard melee
##   nm_stalker     Cursed Wanderer        — humanoid melee (Werewolf human shape)
##   nm_raider      Deep One               — slower, meatier melee
##   nm_ambusher    Chest Mimic            — high burst, low mobility
##   nm_aerial      Gargoyle               — fast flying harasser
##   nm_archer      Ratfolk Slinger        — ranged, hurled refuse
##   nm_caster      Brain Slayer           — ranged, psychic bolt (Void)
##   nm_royal       Ratfolk Monarch        — elite ranged, thrown rat
##   nm_spore       Predatory Mushroom     — near-stationary zone turret (Poison)
##   nm_brute       Demon Spider           — heavy
##   nm_heavy       Giant                  — heaviest rank-and-file
##
## Scenes are generated by tools/gen_nightmare_scenes.gd. Registered in EnemyRegistry.
##
## Scaling intent: biome 3 sits roughly 1.5x the equivalent Catacombs role. Catacombs
## reference: fodder 14hp/8dmg, swarmer 9/6 spd138, skirmisher 22/10/2armor, raider 38/14/3.

